PROJECT: COMPLETE DIGITAL RESTAURANT MENU & MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
Act as a senior full-stack software architect, UI/UX designer, database engineer, cybersecurity specialist, and professional software developer.
I want you to design and develop a complete, professional, production-ready Digital Restaurant Menu and Management System based on the attached reference image and system diagrams.
This must be a real, functional web application, not just a UI design, prototype, static HTML page, or demonstration.
The system must support four main interfaces:
1.	Customer Mobile Digital Menu
2.	Staff Order Management and Checkout
3.	Chef Kitchen Display System (KDS)
4.	Admin Dashboard and Restaurant Management
The application should be modern, responsive, multilingual, secure, easy to operate, and suitable for real restaurants.
