1. PROJECT OBJECTIVES
Create a complete restaurant system that allows:
•	Customers to scan a QR code at their restaurant table.
•	Customers to view the digital food and beverage menu.
•	Customers to select food, customize items, and add them to a cart.
•	Customers to submit orders directly from their phones.
•	Staff to receive, confirm, and manage customer orders.
•	Chefs to receive orders and update preparation status.
•	Staff to deliver food and update order status.
•	Customers to pay using KHQR or cash, where enabled.
•	Staff to verify payments and generate digital PDF receipts.
•	Administrators to manage menus, categories, restaurant tables, staff, chefs, orders, payments, reports, and system settings.
The system must support multiple restaurant tables and multiple orders within one active table session.
