5.6 Static KHQR Payment
Implement Static KHQR payment according to the supplied system proposal.
Process:
1.	Staff selects KHQR.
2.	System displays the restaurant's configured Static KHQR.
3.	Customer scans the QR code.
4.	Customer enters the amount and transfers the payment.
